| CBR: constant bit rate, tried by vcenc 0.1.2 three ways (each with the
| encoder made again: 2 at the enable, 4 at the enable, then variable and
| constant once running), at 360p, 720p and 1080p, with variable at the same
| bit rates to compare. Every stream decoded again. Reports to ResultC.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 40960K -max 40960K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultC
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -v -s 640x360 -n 40 -c -b 2000000 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultC
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 100 -c -b 2000000 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultC
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 640x360 -n 100 -b 2000000 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultC
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 1280x720 -n 100 -c -b 3000000 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultC
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 1280x720 -n 100 -b 3000000 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultC
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcenctest -d -t -s 1920x1080 -n 100 -r 30 -c -b 8000000 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultC
